# ReactAdmin React flow (for PHP / Laravel minds)

Inspiration: [`developer-guide-flow-cursor.md`](../../developer-guide-flow-cursor.md) (Acensure). Adapt to Veyra — do not copy Acensure folders (`src/dev`, `UseApiQuery` names).

## Mental map

| PHP / Laravel | Veyra React |
| :--- | :--- |
| Controller | Route / page orchestrator (`routes/*`, `components/admin/admin.tsx`) |
| Blade / view | Leaf UI under `components/admin/*`, `components/ui/*` |
| Form Request | Zod (+ react-hook-form when real forms ship) |
| Eloquent / HTTP client | TanStack Query later; demo data today |
| `session()->flash()` | `ShowToast` ([Sonner](https://sonner.emilkowal.ski/getting-started)) |
| Bootstrap modal | **Dialog** (forms), **AlertDialog** (confirm), **Sheet** (side create/edit) |

Path alias: `#/*` → `src/*` (not Acensure `@/`).

## How to structure a feature

1. **Orchestrator** owns filters, open/close overlays, which view is active, and calls mutations/handlers.
2. **Leaf components** own layout + form fields (e.g. `shipment-form-sheet.tsx`, `overview-dashboard.tsx`).
3. **Columns / tables** grow into their own files when a page gets heavy.
4. **Primitives** stay in `components/ui/*` (shadcn + Radix). Shared composites in `components/shared/*`.

## Feedback & overlays

| Need | Tool |
| :--- | :--- |
| Success / error after action | `ShowToast.success` / `.error` from `#/lib/toast` |
| Short create/edit | Right **Sheet** |
| Form / detail modal | **Dialog** |
| Destructive confirm | **AlertDialog** (or `ConfirmDialog` wrapper) |
| Multi-step booking | Full **page** wizard — not a Sheet |

Fire toasts from the **same handler** that finishes the action (create, delete, save) — like flashing after a redirect in Laravel.

## Naming

- Components: `PascalCase` (`ShipmentFormSheet`, `FreightDashboard`)
- Hooks: `camelCase` `useX` (Veyra style; Acensure’s PascalCase hooks are not the Veyra convention)
- Mutations (when API lands): `deleteShipmentMutation`, `createOrderMutation`
- Handlers: `handleCreateShipment`, `onOpenChange`

## Checklist (CRUD-style)

- [ ] Page/orchestrator thin; forms/tables split out if large
- [ ] Validation via Zod when submitting real data
- [ ] Overlay role chosen (Sheet / Dialog / AlertDialog)
- [ ] `ShowToast` on success/error in handlers
- [ ] No new `useEffect` without asking ([no-useeffect.mdc](./no-useeffect.mdc))
- [ ] Match local folder style; don’t invent a parallel architecture

## Do / Don’t

**Do:** match nearby files; keep orchestrators orchestration-focused; use `#/` imports; token-based styles.

**Don’t:** mix raw `fetch` with Query in one feature when Query is the standard; put create + table + columns in one huge file; use `useEffect` for toasts or localStorage writes.
